然后条件类型选 **Element exists**。

### No Copy 时怎么处理

对于 user turn，有附件时第一版可以先退化成从 DOM 读取可见文本，不让整个 workflow 报错。

加一个 JavaScript Code 节点：

```js
const selector =
  automaRefData(
    "variables",
    "currentTurnSelector"
  );

const id =
  automaRefData(
    "variables",
    "currentTurnId"
  );

const role =
  automaRefData(
    "variables",
    "currentTurnRole"
  );

const turnNumber =
  automaRefData(
    "variables",
    "currentTurnNumber"
  );

const el =
  document.querySelector(selector);

if (!el) {
  throw new Error(
    `找不到当前 turn: ${selector}`
  );
}

let content = "";

// user 优先取消息正文，不把操作栏混进去
const message =
  el.querySelector(
    `[data-message-author-role="${role}"]`
  );

if (message) {
  content = message.innerText.trim();
} else {
  content = el.innerText.trim();
}

const conversation =
  automaRefData(
    "variables",
    "conversation"
  ) || [];

conversation.push({
  role,
  content,
  turnId: id,
  turnNumber,
  copied: false
});

window.__chatgptSeen.add(id);

automaSetVariable(
  "conversation",
  conversation
);

console.log(
  "[ChatGPT export] fallback extracted",
  {
    turnNumber,
    role,
    total: conversation.length
  }
);
```

这样至少能保证：

* 普通消息：走 Copy，保留 Markdown
* 没 Copy 的特殊 user turn：走 DOM fallback
* 不会因为 `element not found` 整个 workflow 停掉

后面如果你想进一步处理附件，可以再给 fallback 增加：

```js
const attachments = [
  ...el.querySelectorAll(
    '[role="group"][aria-label]'
  )
]
```

把附件文件名一起导出来。现在第一版先做到“不报错 + 文本不丢”就够了。
